# Learning AI Discoveries

An important role of the teacher in the AI Discoveries classroom is to support students in developing authentic computer science and AI practices as they learn new programming skills and build new computer science and AI content knowledge. 

### **You will:**

* Learn about authentic computer science and AI practices that students will develop throughout the AI Discoveries course.


